*

SET SYSMENU TO
SET SYSMENU AUTOMATIC

DEFINE PAD _6bl10i672 OF _MSYSMENU PROMPT "Reference" COLOR SCHEME 3 ;
	KEY ALT+R, ""
DEFINE PAD _6bl10i673 OF _MSYSMENU PROMPT "Master" COLOR SCHEME 3 ;
	KEY ALT+M, ""
DEFINE PAD _6bl10i674 OF _MSYSMENU PROMPT "Reports" COLOR SCHEME 3 ;
	KEY ALT+R, ""
DEFINE PAD _6bl10i675 OF _MSYSMENU PROMPT "Exit" COLOR SCHEME 3 ;
	KEY ALT+E, ""
ON PAD _6bl10i672 OF _MSYSMENU ACTIVATE POPUP reference
ON PAD _6bl10i673 OF _MSYSMENU ACTIVATE POPUP master
ON PAD _6bl10i674 OF _MSYSMENU ACTIVATE POPUP reports
ON SELECTION PAD _6bl10i675 OF _MSYSMENU Quit

DEFINE POPUP reference MARGIN RELATIVE SHADOW COLOR SCHEME 4
DEFINE BAR 1 OF reference PROMPT "Department"
DEFINE BAR 2 OF reference PROMPT "Position"
DEFINE BAR 3 OF reference PROMPT "Supplier"
ON SELECTION BAR 1 OF reference do form "department.scx"
ON SELECTION BAR 2 OF reference do form "position.scx"
ON SELECTION BAR 3 OF reference do form "supplier.scx"

DEFINE POPUP master MARGIN RELATIVE SHADOW COLOR SCHEME 4
DEFINE BAR 1 OF master PROMPT "Employee"
ON SELECTION BAR 1 OF master DO FORM empsearch

DEFINE POPUP reports MARGIN RELATIVE SHADOW COLOR SCHEME 4
DEFINE BAR 1 OF reports PROMPT "Department"
DEFINE BAR 2 OF reports PROMPT "Supplier"
DEFINE BAR 3 OF reports PROMPT "Position"
ON SELECTION BAR 1 OF reports do DepReport
ON SELECTION BAR 2 OF reports Do SupReport
ON SELECTION BAR 3 OF reports Do PosReport
